# Force LF line endings for text files regardless of the checking-out
# platform's git config (e.g. Windows runners/machines that default to
# autocrlf=true) — confirmed live to matter: a CRLF-converted CHANGELOG.md
# broke a Windows release build whose line-based parsing assumed LF.
# Binary assets are marked explicitly so git never tries to diff/convert them.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
